+
+- [x] Carry the two frames in `CHANGELOG.md` under `## [Unreleased]` (MINOR bump: additive protocol frames). Written for the behaviour this branch built — no opt-in flag, no new error code, `SERVER_ERROR` reused — so the entry matches the acceptance tests rather than the issue's amended criteria.
